03,0.001,0.0,0.0,0.0,0.001,0.001,0.0],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"You wait in your cell for days feeling sorry for yourself when you hear a rattling and see Mr Boots, the monkey, approach with the keys on a chain.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.352,"end":8.672,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":29},"large":{"start":0.352,"end":8.28,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":29,"words":29},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"\"It was bloody hard to find you,\" he says. \"They've gone and filed you under 910.45 (Ocean travel and seafaring adventures) rather than 364.164 (Violent offences against property). Still, I'll have you out in a jiffy.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":9.056,"end":26.82,"frac":0.974,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":38},"large":{"start":9.056,"end":26.74,"frac":0.895,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":38},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You make your escape with Mr Boots, promising him a promotion to lieutenant, then on to The Sea Cat to set sail. Neckbeard has a head start on you, but that’s fine–you never liked things the easy way–you are a pirate Captain after all! Yoho!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.392,"end":43.104,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":45,"words":47},"large":{"start":27.392,"end":43.104,"frac":0.979,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":47},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Time to show off your finished pirate coat of arms proudly! Share to social with the hashtag #apiratecaptain and #pirateslife Check your list to see how successful you were at hunting down crew and supplies. You can play again to try and improve your score! Yo ho!","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":44.288,"end":62.208,"frac":0.979,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":47},"large":{"start":44.288,"end":62.208,"frac":0.979,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":47},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"There are 4 different endings and 12 different combinations of crew and supplies you could collect. Can you complete all the pathways?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":22},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":22},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6901522c287f2_PC%20JM11_monkey.png"}